Description: The Living Moon Colony (Luna-Quest)
 A walkable, data-driven lunar colony game set on the Shackleton rim. Keep
 nine people alive for 30 Earth days by balancing air, water, power, food,
 dust, radiation, sleep and time.
 .
 This is the pure-GDScript build: one self-contained binary with its data
 embedded. No Godot editor, no .NET runtime, no Python and no extra downloads
 are needed. Start it from the applications menu or run `luna-quest`.
Homepage: https://github.com/Mostafa-Taher-git/Luna-Quest
